  "statement": "Ethical and compliance considerations are crucial for the ATM system. RES-01 ensures all transactions comply with financial regulations, crucial for accountability and legal adherence. RES-02 mandates transaction logs for audit and transparency, while RES-03 prevents negative balances, promoting fairness in financial transactions. RES-04 reinforces secure user authentication, aligned with user privacy standards. RES-05 ensures funds are only withdrawn when sufficient, maintaining user trust. RES-06 provides immediate notifications for insufficient funds, preventing unfair transaction attempts. Finally, RES-07 ensures user privacy through data encryption, aligning with social responsibility. Together, these requirements uphold ethical standards in the ATM system.",
